XXXX XXXX XXXX {$9300.00} The below item is being reported as an outstanding debt on my credit report. the original debtor has requested that the credit agency remove the negative mark from my report as this debt was settled with them about 9 months ago. 
I disputed this item through the website and after 93 days i still have not received an update on the investigation. when i called the credit agency for an update, they stated that a " glitch '' in the system caused my dispute to get sent to the wrong creditor. a week after and 100 days after i submitted my request for an investigation, my report started reflecting : Dispute resolved and i was sent a letter stating that the item was reporting correctly. 
the credit agency took over 100 days to investigate my issue no communication or updates were sent to me regarding my dispute for 93 days XXXX XXXX XXXX {$9300.00}

I sent a letter to have XXXX XXXX XXXX to have them Verify my debt In with my signature of where i signed, payment history, etc. All they sent me was a letter to settle the debt. 
windstream is the original debitor. i want this removed from my credit reports. I did not incur these charges or ever reside at the residence where XXXX was purchased. 

Last Reported XX/XX/XXXX Collection Agency XXXX XXXX Original Creditor XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX Status Open Opened Date XX/XX/XXXX Closed Date -- Responsibility Individual Balance {$1000.00} High Balance {$1000.00}

XXXX 2013 I Took out a XXXX dollar loan with XXXX XXXX. immediately I was charged a {$500.00} Processing Fee. when they money and the paper work came in I found out that I was paying 233.40 percent annum on this loan. I felt like I was getting taken advantage of because the way they processed the loan I was not aware that the interest rate was so high. My payment was XXXX per month. the total loan pay back was {$4800.00} and the interest pay back was {$3800.00}. My loan was transferred to Cash Call in California before my first Payment was ever maid. I thought something seemed fishy but I went on to pay the loan and pay it off on time. The loan was drawn directly from my bank account on ACH. I recently found out about this Lawsuit that the CFPD had with Cash Call and come to learn that Cash Call and XXXX was breaking the law with this loan and they were over charging interest and Processing fees to me. NC State Statute XXXX caps the interest rate at 30 % and only allows lenders to charge us {$25.00} Processing Fee. According to North Carolina Law I should have only paid {$360.00} in interest and Fees. I was over charged by {$3900.00}. List below is a loan calculator results with what should have been a legal loan with western sky and Cash Call. I certainly hope that CFPD follows up with this and I can see a refund of all the over charged interest and fees. 

Calculation ResultsThe calculation results for the loan payoff calculator appear below. 
{$1000.00} LoanMonths to pay off debt:XXXXTotal interest you will pay : $ XXXXTotal to pay back : {$1300.00}

I have informed the Credit Reporting Agencies on XX/XX/XXXX of the inaccuracies and have asked them to have the Collection companies remove them from my report. I explained how I had medical insurance at the time and the insurance company paid 90 % of the bills. However, they refused to pay these smaller bills claiming I had secondary insurance ( which was inaccurate ) Now, I still have not heard back from XXXX regarding my request. 

Plus, my other complaint is by filing a complaint/request with XXXX they have lowered my score by over 20 points. I do not understand ... 

